ITT API (ittapi) - built from source at build time from public upstream.

Component:   ittapi (ittnotify static library and headers)
Upstream:    https://github.com/intel/ittapi
Version:     pinned by ITT_HASH in tools/unitrace/CMakeLists.txt, the single
             source of truth (not repeated here)
License:     BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-only (dual); used under BSD-3-Clause
             (see ./LICENSE)

How it is used: scripts/get_itt.py clones ittapi at ITT_HASH and builds
libittnotify. unitrace_tool uses the ittapi headers to collect ITT task/frame
annotations (BUILD_WITH_ITT); unitrace_mpi links libittnotify statically when
BUILD_WITH_MPI is enabled.

To bump: update ITT_HASH in tools/unitrace/CMakeLists.txt, refresh LICENSE from
upstream (LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt) at the new commit, and update
tools/unitrace/third-party-programs.txt if the license changed.
